{
  "id": "poem-c13dadea791556f1e2f04926",
  "title": "生查子·一岁会盘洲",
  "author": "洪适",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "一岁会盘洲，月月生查子。",
    "弟劝复兄酬，举案灯花喜。",
    "曲终人半酣，添酒留罗绮。",
    "车马不须喧，且听三更未。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.8000.json#record-731",
